# CODEOWNERS
#
# Each line matches a path pattern and lists the GitHub users/teams that own it.
# Owners are automatically requested for review on every PR that touches their paths.
#
# Syntax: <pattern>  <@user or @org/team>
# Docs: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/managing-your-repositorys-settings-and-features/customizing-your-repository/about-code-owners

# ── Default owner for everything not matched below ────────────────────────────
# This catch-all ensures every file — including any NEW domain added in future —
# always has at least one required reviewer. No update needed when adding domains.
*                                   @code-maca/placeholder-owner

# ── Contracts (shared across layers) ─────────────────────────────────────────
packages/contracts/                 @code-maca/placeholder-owner

# ── Frontend shared packages ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
packages/ui/                        @code-maca/placeholder-owner
packages/mobile-ui/                 @code-maca/placeholder-owner
packages/client-common/             @code-maca/placeholder-owner

# ── Webapp + mobile ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
apps/webapp/                        @code-maca/placeholder-owner
apps/webapp-e2e/                    @code-maca/placeholder-owner
apps/mobile/                        @code-maca/placeholder-owner

# ── CI / Infrastructure ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.github/                            @code-maca/placeholder-owner
.github/workflows/                  @code-maca/placeholder-owner
scripts/                            @code-maca/placeholder-owner
docker-compose.yml                  @code-maca/placeholder-owner
nx.json                             @code-maca/placeholder-owner
tsconfig.base.json                  @code-maca/placeholder-owner

# ── Optional: per-domain backend ownership ────────────────────────────────────
# Uncomment and extend these if you want a backend team specifically requested
# rather than (or in addition to) the catch-all team above.
#
# packages/{domain}-domain/         @xnnx-c-xrxnxs/backend
# apps/{domain}/                    @xnnx-c-xrxnxs/backend
#
# ── For new projects created from this template ─────────────────────────────
# Run `node scripts/task-helpers/setup-branch-protection.mjs --rename-codeowners`
# to replace `@code-maca/placeholder-owner` with your org/team across this file.
